---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const ld = [{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://dsignpoint.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Privacy Policy", "item": "https://dsignpoint.com/privacy-policy/"}]}];
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | DsignPoint" description="How DsignPoint collects, uses and protects your personal data, and the rights you have under the GDPR." path="/privacy-policy/"    jsonld={ld}>


<div style="position:relative;overflow-x:clip;">
<section style="position:relative;background:oklch(12% 0.06 18);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding-bottom:clamp(56px,9vh,110px);">
    <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px clamp(20px,5vw,56px);width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
      <a href=".." class="dp-logo" aria-label="DsignPoint home"><span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;"><img src="../uploads/DP-icon-yvoir-cropped.png" alt="" style="height:48px;width:auto;display:block;"><img src="../uploads/DP-wordmark-yvoir-cropped.png" alt="DsignPoint" style="height:24px;width:auto;display:block;"></span></a>
      <button type="button" class="dp-burger" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="dp-nav"><span></span><span></span></button><div id="dp-nav" role="navigation" aria-label="Main" class="dp-nav-links" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(14px,2vw,30px);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;">
        <a href=".." style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Home</a>
        <a href="../approach/" style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Approach</a>
        <a href="../case-studies/" style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Case Studies</a>
        <a href="../insights/" style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Insights</a>
        <a href="../about/" style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">About</a>
        <a href="../book-a-call/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:1px solid oklch(83% 0.05 80);background:oklch(83% 0.05 80);color:oklch(24% 0.11 15);padding:12px 24px;font-weight:600;box-shadow:0 8px 28px oklch(83% 0.05 80 / 0.35);transition:background 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease, gap 0.35s ease;" class="h1">Book a call <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>


<div style="width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(56px,10vh,120px) clamp(20px,5vw,56px) 0;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 24px;">Legal</p><h1 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(40px,6.4vw,88px);line-height:1.0;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0 0 28px;max-width:14ch;">Privacy Policy</h1><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 22px;max-width:50ch;color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">How DsignPoint collects, uses and protects your personal data, in plain English.</p><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 0px;">Last updated · 18 November 2026</p></div>
</section>
<section style="background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);padding:clamp(56px,9vh,110px) 0;"><div style="width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(32px,6vw,96px);align-items:flex-start;"><div style="flex:0 1 300px;min-width:240px;position:sticky;top:100px;align-self:flex-start;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 14px;">On this page</p><a href="#who" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">01</span>Who we are</a><a href="#data" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">02</span>What data we collect</a><a href="#basis" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">03</span>Why we use your data, and our legal basis</a><a href="#share" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">04</span>Who we share your data with</a><a href="#transfers" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">05</span>International transfers</a><a href="#cookies" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">06</span>Cookies and similar technologies</a><a href="#retention" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">07</span>How long we keep your data</a><a href="#rights" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">08</span>Your rights</a><a href="#security" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">09</span>Security</a><a href="#changes" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">10</span>Changes to this policy</a></div><div style="flex:1 1 520px;max-width:760px;"><div id="who" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">01</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Who we are</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 18px;">This website is operated by <strong style="font-weight:600;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);">DSIGNPOINT SC</strong> (“DsignPoint”, “we”, “us”), a Spanish <em>sociedad civil</em> with tax ID (CIF) <strong style="font-weight:600;">J42645499</strong> and registered address in Torrevieja, Spain.</p><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">We are the data controller for the personal data described in this policy. You can contact us at any time at <a href="mailto:info@dsignpoint.com" style="color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);border-bottom:1px solid oklch(33% 0.14 17);">info@dsignpoint.com</a>.</p></div><div id="data" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">02</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">What data we collect</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 18px;">We only collect what we need, depending on how you use the website:</p><ul style="margin:0 0 22px;padding-left:22px;"><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Enquiry and booking form:</strong> your name, email address, business name or website, the stage your business is at, and the message you write to us.</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Booking a call:</strong> the details you enter on our scheduling page (name, email, notes and the time you choose).</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Emails and conversations:</strong> whatever you share with us when you write to us or speak to us.</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Usage data:</strong> pages visited, device and browser type, approximate location and similar technical data, collected through cookies and analytics tools, if you accept them.</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Advertising data:</strong> once we run advertising campaigns, information about how you interact with our ads and website (for example pages viewed or forms sent), collected through the Meta Pixel, if you accept marketing cookies.</li></ul><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">We do not ask for sensitive personal data, and we don’t knowingly collect data from children.</p></div><div id="basis" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">03</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Why we use your data, and our legal basis</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Under the GDPR we need a legal basis for each use of your data:</p><ul style="margin:0 0 22px;padding-left:22px;"><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">To reply to your enquiry and arrange a call</strong> (steps taken at your request before a possible contract, and your consent when you submit the form).</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">To send you emails you have asked for,</strong> such as your booking link and follow-ups about your enquiry. We only send marketing emails or newsletters if you have agreed to receive them, and every email includes a way to unsubscribe.</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">To understand how the website is used and improve it</strong> (your consent, through the cookie banner).</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">To measure and improve our advertising campaigns</strong> on Facebook and Instagram (your consent, through the cookie banner).</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">To keep the website secure and prevent spam or abuse</strong> (our legitimate interest).</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">To meet legal obligations,</strong> such as accounting and tax rules if you become a client.</li></ul><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">We never sell your personal data.</p></div><div id="share" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">04</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Who we share your data with</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 18px;">We use trusted providers to run the website and our communication. They only process your data on our behalf and under their own data protection commitments:</p><ul style="margin:0 0 22px;padding-left:22px;"><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Cal.com</strong> for call bookings and calendar scheduling.</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Brevo</strong> (Sendinblue SAS, France) to store enquiry contacts and send the emails described above.</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Google</strong> (Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager, Google Search Console, Google Fonts and Google Workspace for email and documents).</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Meta Platforms Ireland Limited</strong> (Facebook and Instagram) through the Meta Pixel, only when advertising is active and you have accepted marketing cookies. For this data Meta and DsignPoint may act as joint controllers under Meta’s terms for business tools.</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Our hosting provider</strong> (Infomaniak, Switzerland) which stores the website and its files.</li></ul><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">We may also share data with public authorities when the law requires it, or with professional advisers (for example our accountant) when strictly necessary.</p></div><div id="transfers" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">05</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">International transfers</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">Some of the providers above, such as Google, Meta and Cal.com, may process data outside the European Economic Area, including in the United States. When that happens we rely on safeguards recognised by European law, such as the EU–US Data Privacy Framework or Standard Contractual Clauses. Switzerland benefits from an adequacy decision of the European Commission.</p></div><div id="cookies" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">06</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Cookies and similar technologies</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Cookies are small files stored on your device. We use:</p><ul style="margin:0 0 22px;padding-left:22px;"><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Necessary cookies,</strong> required for the website to work and to remember your cookie choice. These don’t need consent.</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Analytics cookies</strong> (Google Analytics), which help us see which pages are useful. These are only activated if you accept them.</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Marketing cookies</strong> (Meta Pixel), which let us measure our ads and show them to people who might be interested. These are only activated if you accept them.</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Google Fonts and other Google content,</strong> which can involve your IP address being sent to Google’s servers so the content can load.</li></ul><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">You can accept, reject or change your choice at any time through the cookie banner, and you can also delete cookies in your browser settings. You can manage the ads you see on Facebook and Instagram in your Meta ad preferences.</p></div><div id="retention" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">07</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">How long we keep your data</h2><ul style="margin:0 0 22px;padding-left:22px;"><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Enquiries and booking details:</strong> for as long as needed to deal with your request and for up to 24 months after our last contact, unless you become a client.</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Client records and invoices:</strong> for the period required by Spanish accounting and tax law (generally up to six years).</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Analytics data:</strong> no longer than 14 months.</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Advertising cookies (Meta Pixel):</strong> they expire after up to 90 days, and Meta keeps the data it receives according to its own privacy policy.</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Marketing emails:</strong> until you unsubscribe or withdraw your consent.</li></ul><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">When the period ends, we delete or anonymise the data.</p></div><div id="rights" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">08</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Your rights</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 18px;">You have the right to access your data, correct it, ask us to delete it, restrict or object to how we use it, receive it in a portable format, and withdraw your consent at any time (without affecting what we did before you withdrew).</p><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 18px;">To use any of these rights, email us at <a href="mailto:info@dsignpoint.com" style="color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);border-bottom:1px solid oklch(33% 0.14 17);">info@dsignpoint.com</a>. We may need to confirm your identity and we’ll reply within one month.</p><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">If you feel your rights haven’t been respected, you can complain to the Spanish data protection authority, the <strong style="font-weight:600;">Agencia Española de Protección de Datos (AEPD)</strong>, at <a href="https://www.aepd.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);border-bottom:1px solid oklch(33% 0.14 17);">www.aepd.es</a>.</p></div><div id="security" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">09</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Security</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">We use reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your data, including secure connections (HTTPS), restricted access and reputable providers. No online service is completely risk-free, but we take your privacy seriously and will act promptly if there is ever a problem.</p></div><div id="changes" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">10</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Changes to this policy</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">We may update this policy from time to time, for example if we add a new tool or the law changes. The date at the top of this page shows when it was last updated. If the changes are significant, we’ll make that clear on the website.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
